              "value": "Death Throes"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(alchemical, poison)\n\nWhen one of Ingnovim's assistants dies, it bursts open in a foul-sounding and smelling explosion of toxic viscera and poisonous vapors.\n\nAll creatures within a 20-foot burst must attempt a 38 Fortitude save to resist this blast of poison.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The creature is sickened 2.\n- **Failure:** The creature takes 7d8 poison damage.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature takes 14d8 poison damage and 2d8 persistent poison damage."
